msgstr "Comparison of Learning Rate Scheduling Strategies"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:601
msgid "1. 步长衰减（Step Decay）"
msgstr "1. Step Decay"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:603
msgid "**策略**：每N个epoch，学习率乘以衰减系数（如0.1）"
msgstr "**Strategy**: Multiply the learning rate by a decay factor (e.g., 0.1) every N epochs"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:605
#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:623
#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:639
msgid "**适用场景**："
msgstr "**Applicable Scenarios**:"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:607
msgid "传统图像分类任务（ImageNet训练标配）"
msgstr "Traditional image classification tasks (standard for ImageNet training)"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:608
msgid "当验证集损失不再下降时手动降低学习率"
msgstr "Manually reducing learning rate when validation loss stops decreasing"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:610
msgid ""
"# 每30个epoch，学习率乘以0.1\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.StepLR(optimizer, step_size=30, gamma=0.1)"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"# Multiply learning rate by 0.1 every 30 epochs\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.StepLR(optimizer, step_size=30, gamma=0.1)"
"\n"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:615
msgid "**特点**：阶梯式下降，简单有效，但需要预设衰减时机。"
msgstr "**Characteristics**: Stepwise reduction, simple and effective, but requires preset decay timing."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:617
msgid "2. 指数衰减（Exponential Decay）"
msgstr "2. Exponential Decay"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:619
msgid "**策略**：每个epoch学习率按指数衰减"
msgstr "**Strategy**: Exponentially decay learning rate every epoch"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:621
msgid "\\eta_t = \\eta_0 \\cdot \\gamma^t"
msgstr "\\eta_t = \\eta_0 \\cdot \\gamma^t"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:625
msgid "需要平滑连续衰减"
msgstr "Smooth, continuous decay is required"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:626
msgid "训练轮数较多时"
msgstr "When training for a large number of epochs"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:628
msgid ""
"# 每个epoch学习率乘以0.95\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.ExponentialLR(optimizer, gamma=0.95)\n"
msgstr ""
"# Multiply learning rate by 0.95 every epoch\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.ExponentialLR(optimizer, gamma=0.95)\n"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:633
msgid "3. 余弦退火（Cosine Annealing）"
msgstr "3. Cosine Annealing"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:635
msgid "**策略**：学习率按余弦函数从初始值降到接近0"
msgstr "**Strategy**: Learning rate decays along a cosine curve from initial value to near 0"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:637
msgid ""
"\\eta_t = \\eta_{min} + \\frac{1}{2}(\\eta_{max} - \\eta_{min})(1 + "
"\\cos(\\frac{t}{T_{max}}\\pi))"
msgstr ""
"\\eta_t = \\eta_{min} + \\frac{1}{2}(\\eta_{max} - \\eta_{min})(1 + "
"\\cos(\\frac{t}{T_{max}}\\pi))"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:641
msgid "现代Transformer模型（BERT、GPT等）"
msgstr "Modern Transformer models (BERT, GPT, etc.)"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:642
msgid "配合Warmup使用效果更佳"
msgstr "Works even better when combined with Warmup"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:644
msgid "scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=100)\n"
msgstr "scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(optimizer, T_max=100)\n"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:648
msgid "4. 预热（Warmup）"
msgstr "4. Warmup"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:650
msgid "**问题**：训练初期参数随机初始化，梯度可能很大且不稳定，大学习率会导致震荡。"
msgstr "**Problem**: At the beginning of training, parameters are randomly initialized; gradients can be large and unstable, so a large learning rate can cause oscillation."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:652
msgid "**策略**：从很小的学习率开始，线性增加到目标学习率。"
msgstr "**Strategy**: Start with a very small learning rate and linearly increase it to the target learning rate."

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:655
msgid "Warmup + Cosine Annealing"
msgstr "Warmup + Cosine Annealing"

#: ../../../source/math-fundamentals/gradient-descent.md:674
msgid ""
"# 组合使用：Warmup + Cosine Annealing\n"
"scheduler1 = optim.lr_scheduler.LinearLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    start_factor=0.01,      # 从1%的目标学习率开始\n"
"    end_factor=1.0,\n"
"    total_iters=5           # 前5个epoch预热\n"
")\n"
"scheduler2 = optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    T_max=95                # 剩余95个epoch余弦退火\n"
")\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.SequentialLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    schedulers=[scheduler1, scheduler2], \n"
"    milestones=[5]\n"
")\n"
msgstr ""
"# Combined usage: Warmup + Cosine Annealing\n"
"scheduler1 = optim.lr_scheduler.LinearLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    start_factor=0.01,      # Start from 1% of target learning rate\n"
"    end_factor=1.0,\n"
"    total_iters=5           # Warmup for first 5 epochs\n"
")\n"
"scheduler2 = optim.lr_scheduler.CosineAnnealingLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    T_max=95                # Cosine annealing for remaining 95 epochs\n"
")\n"
"scheduler = optim.lr_scheduler.SequentialLR(\n"
"    optimizer, \n"
"    schedulers=[scheduler1, scheduler2], \n"
"    milestones=[5]\n"
")\n"

